<title>SOUTH KOREA: Soccer-Results of South Korean pro-soccer games.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Results of South Korean pro-soccer games.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South Korean pro-soccer games played on Wednesday.</p>
<p> Chonan	2    Suwon	 2   (halftime 1-2)</p>
<p> Pusan	 2    Ulsan	 0   (halftime 2-0)</p>
<p>Standings after games played on Wednesday (Tabulate under won, drawn, lost, goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p>			 W     D    L    G/F   G/A    P</p>
<p> Puchon		5     2    1    13     7    17</p>
<p> Pohang		4     2    1    16    13    14</p>
<p> Chonnam	     3     3    1    10     7    12</p>
<p> Suwon		 2     5    0    10     5    11</p>
<p> Chonan		3     2    2    18    16    11</p>
<p> Anyang		1     5    2    12    14     8</p>
<p> Pusan		 1     4    4    11    17     7</p>
<p> Ulsan		 2     0    6    13    18     6</p>
<p> Chonbuk	     1     1    5     6    12     4</p>
